      "message": "Raw hex color — use a design-system color token via var()."
    },
    {
      "kind": "literal",
      "pattern": "\\b\\d+px\\b",
      "flags": "",
      "message": "Raw px value — use a design-system spacing token via var(). Breakpoints come from src/ds/breakpoints.ts (via the ds barrel).",
      "exemptFilesNote": "CSS custom properties do not work inside @media params, so breakpoints are literal px. The ONE sanctioned TS home is src/ds/breakpoints.ts (BREAKPOINT_TABBAR = 960, BREAKPOINT_ONE_COLUMN = 640, mediaQuery()). Exact paths relative to web/ (or to a fixture set root); no globs. CSS @media params are not declarations, so stylelint already allows px there.",
